{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Below is a complete **Shopify AI prompt** that recreates your existing contact section while keeping **all of the same contact information** and updating it to match the premium RootSyntax design.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify AI Prompt
    
    Create a premium **Contact Us** section that keeps the same information and layout as the current contact page but redesigns it to match the RootSyntax website with a modern dark UI.
    
    ## Overall Style
    
    * Background: #050505
    * Two-column layout (65% form / 35% contact details)
    * Maximum width: 1400px
    * Section padding: 100px top and bottom
    * Rounded glass cards with 24px border radius
    * Card background: #0F0F12
    * Border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    * Subtle orange glow (#FF7A00) and purple glow (#6C4CFF)
    * White headings
    * Light gray body text
    * Smooth hover animations
    * Mobile responsive
    
    ---
    
    # LEFT COLUMN
    
    ## Heading
    
    **GET IN TOUCH**
    
    Large bold white heading.
    
    ---
    
    ## Contact Form
    
    Create the following fields exactly.
    
    ### Row 1
    
    * Name
    * Email *
    
    ### Row 2
    
    * Phone Number *
    
    ### Row 3
    
    Large Message textarea
    
    ---
    
    ## Timeline
    
    Display three selectable pills instead of radio buttons.
    
    Options:
    
    ⚡ ASAP
    
    📅 1–2 Months
    
    🚀 3–6 Months
    
    Selected option should have
    
    * Orange border
    * Orange glow
    * Dark orange background
    * White text
    
    ---
    
    ## Book A Time Slot
    
    Three modern inputs
    
    * Date
    * Time
    * AM / PM
    
    Dark input styling with rounded corners.
    
    ---
    
    ## Submit Button
    
    Full-width gradient button.
    
    Gradient
    
    #FF7A00 → #6C4CFF
    
    Button text
    
    **SEND**
    
    Rounded corners
    
    Glow on hover
    
    ---
    
    ## Consent
    
    Keep the same consent text below the button.
    
    ---
    
    # RIGHT COLUMN
    
    Create a premium information panel.
    
    ---
    
    ## Heading
    
    **WE'D LOVE TO HEAR FROM YOU.**
    
    Large white heading.
    
    ---
    
    ## Working Hours Card
    
    Use a small glass card.
    
    Clock icon inside an orange circular background.
    
    ### WORKING HOURS:
    
    Monday to Friday – 9:30 am to 4 pm EST
    
    ---
    
    ## Email Card
    
    Envelope icon inside an orange gradient circle.
    
    ### EMAIL US:
    
    [info@rootsyntax.com](mailto:info@rootsyntax.com)
    
    Hover effect changes text to orange.
    
    ---
    
    ## Phone Card
    
    Phone icon inside an orange gradient circle.
    
    ### CONTACT NUMBER:
    
    +1 352-218-5661
    
    ---
    
    # Office Locations
    
    Create two stacked office cards.
    
    Each card should have:
    
    * Background: #18181D
    * Border: rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    * Border radius: 18px
    * Padding: 24px
    * Hover lift animation
    * Orange border glow on hover
    
    ---
    
    ## USA Office Card
    
    Replace plain "US" text with a premium location icon.
    
    ### Icon Style
    
    * 56px circular icon
    * Orange gradient background (#FF7A00 → #FF9D2F)
    * White location pin icon
    * Soft orange glow
    
    ### Content
    
    **USA, FLORIDA**
    
    6160 SW Highway 200
    
    Ste. 110 PMB508
    
    Ocala, FL 34486
    
    7901 4TH ST N STE 300,
    
    Saint Petersburg, FL 33702
    
    Right side
    
    Orange arrow icon
    
    ---
    
    ## India Office Card
    
    Use the same icon style.
    
    ### Content
    
    **INDIA, BANGALORE**
    
    91 Springboard Business Hub Private Ltd.,512/10,
    
    Service Lane,
    
    Outer Ring Road,
    
    Mahadevapura,
    
    Bangalore 560048
    
    Right side
    
    Orange arrow icon
    
    ---
    
    # Trust Card
    
    Create a premium card below the office cards.
    
    Card background
    
    #18181D
    
    Rounded corners
    
    20px
    
    Top
    
    ★★★★★
    
    Stars should be
    
    Solid Orange (#FF7A00)
    
    Below
    
    ## 146+ Shopify Projects Delivered
    
    Large bold white text.
    
    Below
    
    98% Client Satisfaction
    
    Muted gray text.
    
    Bottom
    
    Animated gradient progress bar
    
    Orange → Purple
    
    ---
    
    # Icons
    
    All icons throughout the section should use this style.
    
    * Orange gradient circular background
    * White icon
    * Soft glow
    * Consistent size (56px)
    
    Icons required:
    
    * Location
    * Clock
    * Email
    * Phone
    * Calendar
    * Time
    * Arrow
    
    ---
    
    # Animations
    
    * Cards lift 8px on hover.
    * Orange glow on hover.
    * Buttons have animated gradient.
    * Inputs glow orange on focus.
    * Fade-up animation on scroll.
    
    ---
    
    # Theme Editor Settings
    
    Make all text editable from the Shopify Theme Editor, including:
    
    * Heading
    * Form labels
    * Timeline options
    * Working hours
    * Email
    * Phone number
    * Office addresses
    * Button text
    * Colors
    * Background
    * Border radius
    * Padding
    * Gradient colors
    * Show/hide background glow
    
    ---
    
    ### Design Goal
    
    The finished section should feel like a premium enterprise Shopify agency website that matches the RootSyntax homepage. Keep the **same contact information** exactly as provided, but transform the design with a dark luxury aesthetic, orange and purple accents, glassmorphism cards, premium iconography, modern spacing, and polished micro-interactions. It should integrate seamlessly with the rest of the website and maintain a strong conversion-focused design.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 65% 35%;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-contact-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 48px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-contact-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus,
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus,
  .ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_color }}33;
  }

  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-height: 120px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}22;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}44;
  }

  .ai-contact-time-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.button_gradient_end }} 100%);
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .ai-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}66;
  }

  .ai-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.info_heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}33;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}66;
  }

  .ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.icon_gradient_start }} 0%, {{ block.settings.icon_gradient_end }} 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}44;
  }

  .ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-office-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.office_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.office_card_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}33;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }}66;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-address-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-office-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.office_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-contact-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    fill: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-trust-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-progress-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 6px;
    background: {{ block.settings.input_background }};
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-contact-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 100%;
    width: 98%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, {{ block.settings.accent_color }} 0%, {{ block.settings.secondary_accent_color }} 100%);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-contact-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .ai-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-contact-time-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-contact-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.form_heading }}</h2>
      
      {%- form 'contact' -%}
        <div class="ai-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.name_label }}
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[name]"
                class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                required
              >
            </div>
            
            <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.email_label }} *
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[email]"
                class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                required
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-phone-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.phone_label }} *
            </label>
            <input
              type="tel"
              id="contact-phone-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              name="contact[phone]"
              class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              required
            >
          </div>

          <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.message_label }}
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              name="contact[body]"
              class="ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_label }}</label>
            <div class="ai-contact-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <input type="radio" name="contact[timeline]" value="asap" id="timeline-asap-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="display: none;">
              <label for="timeline-asap-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timeline="asap">
                {{ block.settings.timeline_option_1 }}
              </label>
              
              <input type="radio" name="contact[timeline]" value="1-2-months" id="timeline-1-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="display: none;">
              <label for="timeline-1-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timeline="1-2-months">
                {{ block.settings.timeline_option_2 }}
              </label>
              
              <input type="radio" name="contact[timeline]" value="3-6-months" id="timeline-3-6-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="display: none;">
              <label for="timeline-3-6-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-contact-timeline-option-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-timeline="3-6-months">
                {{ block.settings.timeline_option_3 }}
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.booking_label }}</label>
            <div class="ai-contact-time-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <input
                type="text"
                name="contact[date]"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.date_placeholder }}"
                class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
              <input
                type="text"
                name="contact[time]"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.time_placeholder }}"
                class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
              <select name="contact[period]" class="ai-contact-select-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <option value="AM">AM</option>
                <option value="PM">PM</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="ai-contact-submit-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.submit_text }}
          </button>

          <div class="ai-contact-consent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.consent_text }}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-contact-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-contact-info-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.info_heading }}</h2>

      <div class="ai-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-contact-info-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.hours_label }}</div>
          <div class="ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.hours_value }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-contact-info-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.email_info_label }}</div>
          <div class="ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a href="mailto:{{ block.settings.email_value }}">{{ block.settings.email_value }}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-contact-info-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-info-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-contact-info-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.phone_info_label }}</div>
          <div class="ai-contact-info-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a href="tel:{{ block.settings.phone_value }}">{{ block.settings.phone_value }}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-contact-office-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-office-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-contact-office-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.usa_office_title }}</div>
          <div class="ai-contact-office-address-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.usa_office_address }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-office-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-contact-office-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-office-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-contact-office-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.india_office_title }}</div>
          <div class="ai-contact-office-address-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.india_office_address }}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-contact-office-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-contact-trust-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-contact-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..5) %}
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
            </svg>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
